A dancer in ballet slippers performing a delicate tiptoe pose on top of floating geometric code blocks and curly braces, rendered in Piet Mondrian's distinctive style with bold primary colors (red, blue, yellow) separated by thick black grid lines against a white background, the dancer's form abstracted into rectangular shapes while maintaining graceful movement, code syntax symbols transformed into Mondrian-esque compositional elements, clean angular shadows, the entire scene balanced asymmetrically in the neoplasticism tradition, conveying precision and careful first steps into a structured new world.
